rs4dggs-ogc writes the encodings of OGC API - Discrete Global Grid Systems, Part 1: Core (OGC
21-038r1) over the rs4dggs library. It carries four files of the Open Geospatial Consortium
(OGC) unmodified, and four files derived from OGC files with modifications.

